WEBVTT

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.400
(SNIFFLES)

00:00:33.045 --> 00:00:34.963
NEWT: You didn't mean to do it, Leta.

00:00:37.341 --> 00:00:39.092
So it wasn't your fault.

00:00:41.679 --> 00:00:43.054
Oh, Newt.

00:00:47.559 --> 00:00:49.686
You never met a monster
you couldn't love.

00:00:54.692 --> 00:00:55.692
TINA: Leta...

00:00:56.777 --> 00:00:58.695
Do you know who Credence really is?

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.657
Did you know when you swapped them?

00:01:02.741 --> 00:01:03.866
No.

00:01:07.705 --> 00:01:09.455
(RUMBLING)

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:20.383
(PEOPLE CHATTERING)

00:01:26.932 --> 00:01:28.016
JACOB: Queenie?

00:01:30.102 --> 00:01:31.894
(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)

00:01:55.502 --> 00:01:56.836
They're pure-bloods.

00:01:57.171 --> 00:01:58.713
They kill the likes of us for sport.

00:02:01.425 --> 00:02:02.425
Queenie?

00:02:02.551 --> 00:02:04.260
Jacob! (GASPS)

00:02:04.344 --> 00:02:06.179
Honey, you're here! Hi!

00:02:06.346 --> 00:02:07.638
Hi, hon. Hi.

00:02:08.223 --> 00:02:10.141
Oh, honey, I'm so sorry.

00:02:10.309 --> 00:02:12.435
I never should have done it.
I love you so much.

00:02:12.603 --> 00:02:14.520
And you know that I love you, right?

00:02:14.688 --> 00:02:16.773
- Yeah.
- Good. Let's get the hell outta here.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.733
Oh, no, wait a second.

00:02:20.944 --> 00:02:24.447
I just thought maybe we could
hear him first.

00:02:24.531 --> 00:02:26.657
Just listen. That's all.

00:02:27.785 --> 00:02:29.035
What are you talking about?

00:02:34.374 --> 00:02:35.541
It's a trap.

00:02:36.043 --> 00:02:37.043
Yeah.

00:02:38.545 --> 00:02:40.505
Queenie, the family tree.

00:02:40.672 --> 00:02:41.714
It's all been bait.

00:02:43.342 --> 00:02:45.426
We have to find a way out of here
right now.

00:02:47.304 --> 00:02:48.638
You go find the others.

00:02:48.722 --> 00:02:50.014
What are you gonna do?

00:02:50.682 --> 00:02:52.183
I'll think of something.

00:03:08.408 --> 00:03:10.284
(AUDIENCE CHEERING)

00:03:40.566 --> 00:03:43.901
My brothers, my sisters,

00:03:45.487 --> 00:03:46.612
my friends,

00:03:47.573 --> 00:03:51.409
the great gift of your applause
is not for me. No.

00:03:52.411 --> 00:03:54.662
It is for yourselves.

00:03:57.166 --> 00:03:59.208
You came today because of a craving

00:04:01.503 --> 00:04:02.920
and a knowledge

00:04:04.631 --> 00:04:07.592
that the old ways serve us no longer.

00:04:10.721 --> 00:04:14.557
You came today because you crave
something new.

00:04:16.435 --> 00:04:17.685
Something different.

00:04:20.439 --> 00:04:21.772
It is said

00:04:22.232 --> 00:04:25.610
that I hate les non-Magiques.

00:04:26.737 --> 00:04:27.987
The Muggles.

00:04:28.155 --> 00:04:29.989
MAN: Vermin!
GRINDELWALD: The No-Maj.

00:04:31.116 --> 00:04:32.700
The Can't-Spells.

00:04:34.578 --> 00:04:36.287
I do not hate them.

00:04:37.206 --> 00:04:38.539
I do not.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.376
For I do not fight out of hatred.

00:04:44.963 --> 00:04:48.549
I say the Muggles are not lesser,

00:04:49.551 --> 00:04:50.843
but other.

00:04:51.803 --> 00:04:53.137
Not worthless,

00:04:54.723 --> 00:04:56.390
but of other value.

00:04:57.601 --> 00:05:01.771
Not disposable,
but of a different disposition.

00:05:03.023 --> 00:05:05.024
Magic blooms

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:10.112
only in rare souls.

00:05:12.157 --> 00:05:16.244
It is granted to those
who live for higher things.

00:05:17.246 --> 00:05:20.581
Oh, and what a world we would make
for all of humanity.

00:05:20.749 --> 00:05:23.459
We who live for freedom,

00:05:25.045 --> 00:05:26.212
for truth,

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.091
and for love.

00:05:40.435 --> 00:05:42.186
It isn't illegal to listen to him.

00:05:43.313 --> 00:05:44.939
Use minimum force on the crowd.

00:05:46.692 --> 00:05:48.317
We mustn't be what he says we are.

00:05:54.241 --> 00:05:58.953
The moment has come
to share my vision of the future

00:06:00.747 --> 00:06:04.041
that awaits if we do not rise up

00:06:05.794 --> 00:06:10.840
and take our rightful place
in the world.

00:06:18.473 --> 00:06:20.891
(GRINDELWALD INHALING DEEPLY)

00:06:24.313 --> 00:06:25.980
(BLOWING)

00:06:27.482 --> 00:06:28.566
(GUNFIRE)

00:06:29.109 --> 00:06:30.234
(PEOPLE EXCLAIMING IN FEAR)

